B.ag9=s(["If photos are missing and the next driver finds damage, the previous driver is responsible.","Si faltan fotos y el siguiente conductor encuentra da\xf1os, el conductor anterior es responsable.","\u6ca1\u62cd\u9f50\u3001\u4e0b\u4e00\u4f4d\u53f8\u673a\u53d1\u73b0\u8f66\u635f\uff0c\u7531\u4e0a\u4e00\u4f4d\u53f8\u673a\u8d1f\u8d23\u3002"],t.s)
